  "limitations": [
    "Linux KVM qualification on the recorded Intel P/E cores only, with different explicit CALL profiles. LA57 skips remain explicit.",
    "No TLB/cache, concurrent memory, MMIO or unlisted instruction contract. LOCK on these transfers is modeled only as #UD, not as an atomic operation.",
